{"id":"955717781e40a938","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-comb9-fat-stationary-set.md","title":"ZFC Comb9 Fat Stationary Set","display":"df-zfc-comb9-fat-stationary-set — ZFC Comb9 Fat Stationary Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb9-fat-stationary-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb9-fat-stationary-set"],"display":"df-zfc-comb9-fat-stationary-set — ZFC Comb9 Fat Stationary Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb9-fat-stationary-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb9-fat-stationary-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb9-fat-stationary-set — ZFC Comb9 Fat Stationary Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md\">../batch11/58-df-order-type.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,S,C\\in V,\\ S,C\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa,S,C\\in V,\\ S,C\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9FatStationarySet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb9FatStationarySet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md\">../batch11/58-df-order-type.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}fat\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb9FatStationarySet}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\to\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists D\\subseteq C\\cap S\\;\\bigl(\\forall B\\subseteq D\\;((B\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\sup B\\in\\sup D)\\to\\sup B\\in D)\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,D,\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in D\\times D:x\\in y\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}fat\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb9FatStationarySet}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\to\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists D\\subseteq C\\cap S\\;\\bigl(\\forall B\\subseteq D\\;((B\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\sup B\\in\\sup D)\\to\\sup B\\in D)\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,D,\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in D\\times D:x\\in y\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fatness strengthens stationarity: every club intersection contains subsets of every order type below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> that are closed below their own supremum. The closure clause excludes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=D\">\\(B=D\\)</span>; otherwise a limit-order-type witness would be forced to have a maximum.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-order-type.